          "text": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Program implementation</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">AED program development</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Strategic AED placement support for all locations</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Management of State and EMS agency AED registration</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Certified CPR/AED training</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
