          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Dedicated program support</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Exclusive access to LIFELINKcentral AED program manager</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Dedicated account support representative (ASR)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Monthly status updates via ASR-customer call</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Quarterly AED program compliance audit</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Proactive training and maintenance reminders</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
