          "text": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Post-event support</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Onsite AED inspection through our nationwide network of certified service engineers</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Prompt post-event supply replenishment</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">AED data download and clinical event review by a medical director</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Optional onsite employee support</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
